'''Filibuster Invasion''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3. It temporarily overrides a random stage after completing the chapter for the first time. Upon completion, [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]] will be unlocked. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.
