==Trivia==
*Prior to version 8.3.2, [[Filibuster Obstructa]]'s Long Distance had an effective range of 50~4,300, causing him to stand in front of [[Kid Tappa]]. Since the latter does negligible damage, this allowed players to cheese this stage by enabling Sniper the Cat and deploying no units until Filibuster Obstructa was defeated.
*Filibuster Invasion has a [[Music|unique theme]] that is only played in a select few other stages, including [[Hell's All-Stars]] and [[A Whole New World]].
**Parts of this theme sound similar to "[https://youtu.be/51yni6pCXM8 Megalomania]" from the game ''[[wikipedia:Live A Live|Live A Live]]''.
*Filibuster Invasion is the only [[Invasion Stage]] with a [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|equivalent]].
*Both this stage and the zombie outbreak variant share the whirlpool from [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] and [[Immeasurable Power]].
**The island from [[Floating Continent (Into the Future)|Floating Continent]] also appears in the spritesheet and also goes unused in-game

